<%# MEDIUM-024 placeholder: until a real BKC login flow lands, this page
    just explains how to reach BKC. It deliberately does not collect
    credentials. %>
<div class="bkc-sessions-new" style="max-width: 480px; margin: 60px auto; padding: 24px; font-family: sans-serif;">
  <h1>BKC Console Sign-In</h1>
  <p>
    The BKC console authenticates via Firebase. There is no email/password
    form on this page yet.
  </p>
  <p>
    Sign in to the Bokunokoto mobile/web client first, then return to
    <a href="<%= bkc_dashboard_path %>">/bkc</a>. The application will
    forward your Firebase ID token to the server and create a BKC session.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you have lost access, contact a platform admin to re-issue your
    Firebase user record.
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 24px;">
    <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary">Back to Home</a>
  </p>
</div>
